<title>FRANCE: French 1997 budget text adopted by Nat Assembly.</title>
<headline>French 1997 budget text adopted by Nat Assembly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's National Assembly adopted the 1997 budget text on Wednesday with 446 votes in favour and 94 against.</p>
<p>The budget text, which fixes on a government deficit figure of 284.844 billion francs, goes to the Senate on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
